{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your next gen VR plank walking simulator, set high up in New York City. It's the perfect experience to show off your new headset!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778020/extras/6286cee9aa3ce2410a75c538aac1b517.poster.avif?t=1754515805\" width=600 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778020/extras/6286cee9aa3ce2410a75c538aac1b517.webm?t=1754515805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778020/extras/6286cee9aa3ce2410a75c538aac1b517.mp4?t=1754515805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Perfect Intro To VR Experience</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring friends and family together for great laughs as everyone\u2019s knees go weak on a thin plank atop the One Astor Plaza skyscraper!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Next Gen Realism</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We set out to push the limits of what the most realistic plank simulator could be.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778020/extras/aea30f9e5f07ed17dd3f2ab9d24254fb.poster.avif?t=1754515805\" width=600 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778020/extras/aea30f9e5f07ed17dd3f2ab9d24254fb.webm?t=1754515805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778020/extras/aea30f9e5f07ed17dd3f2ab9d24254fb.mp4?t=1754515805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >